er denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":211750,"global_rank":274480,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":45927},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":211744,"global_rank":274494,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":45928},{"name":"mattcwilde/vetrr","owner":"mattcwilde","html_url":"https://github.com/mattcwilde/vetrr","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"GUI to vet the cgm-squared redrock galaxy redshifts","topics":[],"score":211740,"global_rank":307346,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":45929},{"name":"gordonwatts/ami-helper","owner":"gordonwatts","html_url":"https://github.com/gordonwatts/ami-helper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":16,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211739,"global_rank":274508,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":45930},{"name":"RussNavas/PythonAgent","owner":"RussNavas","html_url":"https://github.com/RussNavas/PythonAgent","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A toy LLM agent based on a Boot.dev project","topics":[],"score":211739,"global_rank":274527,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_ran